    "url": "https://rally.news/categories/climate/?article=LOST%2BSPECIES%3A%2BThe%2B%24100m-buck%2Bgamble%3A%2BShould%2Ban%2Bextinct%2BSA%2Bantelope%2Broam%2Bthe%2BCape%2Bagain%3F"
  },
  "researchBrief": "The story about Colossal Biosciences' project to bring back the bluebuck was corroborated by both Rally News and Colossal's own blog. The key points include the $100 million investment, the potential ecological impact, and the significance of reviving an extinct species. The bluebuck's extinction and the project's goals are well-documented in both sources. No specific numbers or claims were exaggerated or invented; all information is based on the available research.",
