  "reel": {
    "script": "There's a plan to bring back an extinct antelope. The bluebuck, with its blue-grey hide, vanished 200 years ago. Its loss left a big hole in the ecosystem. Now, a Texas biotech company is working to revive it. If they succeed, the bluebuck could roam the Cape again. This could help fix ecosystems messed up by humans. It also gives hope to other endangered species. What do you think? Should we bring back extinct species?",
    "hook": "Bringing Back an Extinct Antelope",
