    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "There's a plan to bring back an extinct antelope."
      },
      {
        "text": "The bluebuck, with its blue-grey hide, vanished 200 years ago."
      },
      {
        "text": "Its loss left a big hole in the ecosystem."
      },
      {
        "text": "Now, a Texas biotech company is working to revive it."
      },
      {
        "text": "If they succeed, the bluebuck could roam the Cape again."
      },
      {
        "text": "This could help fix ecosystems messed up by humans."
      },
      {
        "text": "It also gives hope to other endangered species."
      },
      {
        "text": "What do you think?"
      },
      {
        "text": "Should we bring back extinct species?"
      }
